'''Fuu''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that could be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 116
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Fuu
|name2 = Fuu CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Fuu CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit works similarly to [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Flower Cat]], with similar range, but is overall not useful simply due to Dark enemies spawning in gargantuan swarms which a Single Target unit cannot hope to disable. Flower Cat's [[True Form]], Bombercat, outshines it entirely.

